I am still in the shop.
My thin jacket and the grey sweatshirt are in the shopping bag.
I put the green coat on immediately.
It is heavy, but it is very comfortable.
Then I put the yellow hat on.
I am finally wearing warm winter clothing now!
I take my shopping bag and go to the door.
I leave the shop.
Outside on the street, the weather is terrible.
It is a very cold day in March.
An icy wind is blowing.
But I am not freezing today.
The thick coat and the warm hat are fantastic.
I love the new coat, for it is wonderfully long.
I walk to the U-Bahn.
I smile.
For the first time in Berlin, I am truly warm.
